+- Verification run: `gofmt -w .`; `go mod tidy`; focused RED/GREEN tests for `TestHTTP5xxCountMetricDefinition`, `TestTraefikAdapterCollectsWindowedPrometheusMetrics`, `TestTraefikUsageEmitterWritesHTTP5xxCountUsageEventsIdempotently`, and `TestQuotaResourceDomainEnforcesClosedSet`; `go test ./...`; `go test -race ./...`; `go vet ./...`; `go test ./internal/controlplane/...`; `go test -race ./internal/controlplane/...`; `go test -run TestMigrations ./...`; `go test -run TestPolicyMatrix ./...`; `go test -run TestQuotaConcurrency ./...`; `go test -run TestFakeDokploy ./...`; `go test -run TestRedaction ./...`; `golangci-lint run ./...`; pre-commit `scripts/verify.sh --strict --release`.
